# No em dashes

Do not use the em dash character (`—`, U+2014), including doubled forms (`——`).

Prefer a colon, comma, period, or a short rewrite.

```txt
❌ studio—answered in one place
✅ studio: answered in one place
✅ studio. Answered in one place.
```

This applies to locale strings, UI copy, code comments, commit messages, and agent replies.
